{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21368","headline":"送王协律游杭越十韵 · 元稹","name":"送王协律游杭越十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去去莫凄凄，余杭接会稽。\n松门天竺寺，花洞若耶溪。\n浣渚逢新艳，兰亭识旧题。\n山经秦帝望，垒辨越王栖。\n江树春常早，城楼月易低。\n镜呈湖面出，云叠海潮齐。\n章甫官人戴，蓴丝姹女提。\n长干迎客闹，小市隔烟迷。\n纸乱红蓝压，瓯凝碧玉泥。\n荆南无抵物，来日爲侬携。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}